/span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">돕고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이를 통해 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">글로벌 감각을 갖춘 핵심인재</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">를</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">양성</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하기 위하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">미 대학생 연수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(WEST)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">프로그램을 운영하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-